PTX MP+fence-restrict-both+producer-shared
"Both restricted fences: the producer writes its own CTA's shared memory, the consumer reads it through the shared::cluster window (D18). Expected: forbidden."
{
s=0 @cta 0;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                         | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0                             ;
 st.weak.shared::cta s, 1                         | ld.relaxed.cluster r0, f                             ;
 fence.release.sync_restrict::shared::cta.cluster | fence.acquire.sync_restrict::shared::cluster.cluster ;
 st.relaxed.cluster f, 1                          | ld.weak.shared::cluster r1, s                        ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
